# Source video masters — 10.6MB of raw footage that `npm run video` compresses
# into public/video/. The COMPRESSED output is committed, so the site builds
# and deploys from a clean clone without them. The masters are not: binaries
# this size live in a git history forever and can never really be removed.
# Keep them in your own storage; drop them back into media-source/

# Hero source images. 8.5MB of 1672px PNGs that `npm run hero-images`
# compresses into public/hero (largest 1600px AVIF: 67.6KB). The COMPRESSED
# output is committed, so the site builds from a clean clone without these.
public/assets/ if you ever
# need to re-encode.
media-source/

# Hero source images. 8.5MB of 1672px PNGs that `npm run hero-images`
# compresses into public/hero (largest 1600px AVIF: 67.6KB). The COMPRESSED
# output is committed, so the site builds from a clean clone without these.
public/assets/

# Internal specification and planning documents. These carry Trenvo's business
# model, positioning and pricing, and this repository is public — so they are
# deliberately kept out of it. They live on disk and in the local `master`
# branch's history; they are NOT published.
master.md
wireframe.md
implementation.md
